---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Cornerstone Tech Advisory LLP collects, uses and protects personal data.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" lead="Last updated: 24 November 2026" crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  <section class="container pb-section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This policy explains how {site.name} ("Cornerstone", "we", "us") handles personal data when you visit this website or contact us. We aim to follow the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (India) and, where it applies, the GDPR.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Emails you send us.</strong> Your name, email address, company and the contents of your message when you email letsconnect@ or wecare@. Our mailboxes are hosted by Zoho Mail.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data.</strong> Basic security logs held by our hosting provider, and aggregate, cookie-free usage statistics if website analytics are enabled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your enquiry and provide the services you ask about.</li>
        <li>To keep the website secure and prevent abuse.</li>
        <li>To meet legal and contractual obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell personal data and we do not use advertising trackers.</p>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>Our website is hosted by Cloudflare. Email is handled by Zoho Mail. These providers process data only on our instructions and under appropriate safeguards.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and storage</h2>
      <p>This site does not set tracking cookies. Your browser may store a service-worker cache so the site loads quickly and works offline, and a session flag that remembers whether you have already seen the intro animation.</p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry correspondence only as long as needed to respond and for a reasonable period afterwards for business records, unless the law requires longer.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may ask to access, correct or erase your personal data, withdraw consent, or raise a grievance. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email.support}`}>{site.email.support}</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above shows when it was last revised.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
